# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOXUND — .gitignore
# Merged from project policy (Parte 3) + hardened defaults.
# Security entries (*.pem, *.key, logs, env) are non-negotiable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Git (versioned by Git regardless; listed per project policy) ---
.git

# --- .gitignore (ignored by project decision — committed once via `git add -f`) ---
.gitignore

# --- Secrets (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.*
.env.local
.env.*.local
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Node / JS / TS ---
node_modules
dist
build
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Next.js ---
.next
out
.turbo
.vercel

# --- Python (data engine) ---
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.py[cod]
.venv
venv
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
*.egg-info

# --- Supabase ---
.supabase
supabase/.branches
supabase/.temp

# --- Observability / logs ---
*.log
logs
.sentryclirc

# --- Infra / local Postgres (PG-EXIT / DEC-0028) ---
# The reviewed, DIGEST-pinned local stack IS versioned as infra-as-code
# (DEC-0028 supersedes the old "local compose not versioned" policy). Only
# ad-hoc root docker-compose files and personal overrides stay out.
docker-compose*.yml
!infra/postgres/compose.local.yml
compose.override.yml
**/compose.override.yml
# Local Postgres secrets (Docker Compose secrets) — NEVER commit real values.
.local-secrets/
infra/postgres/.local-secrets/

# --- License (per project policy) ---
LICENSE

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json

# --- Local tooling scaffolding (NOT NOXUND artifacts) ---
# Claude Code marketing-skill scaffolding + its lockfile: they land in the
# working tree from local tooling and only add noise to `git status`.
.agents/
skills-lock.json
